      "topic": "Relations and Functions",
      "sub_topic": "Inverse Trigonometric Functions",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "question": "The value of cos\u207b\u00b9(\u221a3/2) + sin\u207b\u00b9(1/\u221a2) is:",
      "options": [
